Z||000021||sid1200||05-17-2000||02:57 PM||||well I will have to come to Chrysler defense here.  first of all the engine is not the Neon engine but actually the 2.4 L DOHC 4 from the Cirrus/Stratus/minivan<P>150hp<P>the platform is only loosely based on the Neon and is in fact heavily reinforced, this thing weights 3100 lbs, vs. 2600 for the Neon.<P>Neon 2.0L 4's head gasket problems were solved after 96, and I have a 95 Cirrus that has just been great, knock on wood.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>wait for the turbo, should be out next year, should be a fun ride.||||reg||1
