Z||000026||cobra427||05-18-2000||10:52 PM||||We will be taking a PT Cruiser to Carlisle this weekend from Ma. I'll give a report on the lkes and dislikes of that car. I'm not a Chrysler fan by any means, but I do have to say that they are a very innovative company. Nice to see someone building something other that a "shoe box". C'mon GM,lets see what you can come up with other than a truck.<P>If you see a Purple one in the fairgrounds ,that would be me. Its the Limited Edition||||reg||1
